  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">New&#xa0;Zealand&#x2019;s contribution&#xa0;will support the Livelihoods and Food Security Fund, a large multi-donor initiative whose purpose is to strengthen the resilience and the livelihoods of poor and vulnerable groups in Myanmar, to withstand various shocks and stressors, including climatic, political, social and economic shocks and stressors.</narrative>
